      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPITY ZEAL (8) took advantage of the inside draw with an all-the-way win last start (19.60) at this track in a Mix 5 over 352m. Great chance to get the job done again. MADRID (2) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (24.10) at Rockhampton in a Mix 5 over 407m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings five times from seven attempts. Will give a great sight again. TOP SHELF TIM (1) is drawn well on the inside. Latest effort finished 4th in a Grade 5 on August 19 over 352m at this track behind Cambla Diva beaten 6 lengths (19.96). Looks a key player on best form. TAKE OVER HAZE (7) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
